<title>USA: Xerox and Ernst &amp; Young in joint venture.</title>
<headline>Xerox and Ernst &amp; Young in joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xerox Corp and Ernst &amp; Young LLP said Wednesday they agreed to provide jointly a range of consulting and systems implementation services to financial services firms.  </p>
<p>The companies said clients will have access to both Xerox's advanced document management products, technology and related consulting and professional services, as well as Ernst &amp; Young's leadership in management consulting, professional services and process innovation.</p>
</text>
